# Raw source/master videos dropped into public/videos/ for review — never commit
# (4GB masters bloat the repo and break the Netlify deploy). The wired film
# encodes live in public/videos/experience/ and stay tracked; the small
# hero/booking encodes are already committed. New top-level drops are ignored.
public/videos/*.mov
public/videos/*.mp4
public/videos/*.webm

